            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Debbie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I loved the simplicity of this salad. It was perfect for a dinner party. A word of caution though....I used spinach and romaine (because I like the crunch of romaine). The romaine turned a reddish color from the dressing which was not very appealing to the eye. It still tasted delicious though and i will make again without the romaine.",
